.TH GURU 1 "November 2026" "THMD-Guru Linux 1.0" "THMD-Guru Global Tech Academy"
.SH NAME
guru \- unified system, security, and academy lab CLI for THMD-Guru Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B guru
.I command
.RI [ arguments... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B guru
is the core command-line management and academy utility for THMD-Guru Linux
(Desktop, Server, and ATTT editions). It supports built-in system diagnostics,
CIS-inspired hardening checks, lab environment management, and extensible
edition plugins under
.IR /usr/lib/guru/commands/ .
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B info
Display system summary with the THMD-Guru Global Tech Academy crest.
.TP
.B status
Check service health, firewall status, and security posture.
.TP
.B harden
Inspect or apply baseline kernel and userland hardening checks.
.TP
.B lab
Manage THMD-Guru Global Tech Academy training lab environments.
.TP
.B welcome
Launch the THMD-Guru Welcome Center (Desktop edition).
.TP
.B console
Display enterprise server endpoints and telemetry (Server edition).
.TP
.B sandbox
Run commands inside an isolated Firejail sandbox (ATTT edition).
.TP
.B stealth
Toggle MAC randomization and network stealth mode (ATTT edition).
